# Dashboard

Requires the Dataview community plugin. Static tables remain in [[01-overview/network-overview]].

## Hosts

```dataview
TABLE hostname, os, status, open_ports, services
FROM "02-hosts"
WHERE contains(file.tags, "host")
SORT ip ASC
```

## Findings

```dataview
TABLE severity, cvss_score, status, hosts
FROM "03-findings"
WHERE contains(file.tags, "finding")
SORT cvss_score DESC
```

## Leads (unverified)

```dataview
LIST FROM "04-leads"
```

## Hosts by role

```dataview
TABLE role, hostname, open_ports
FROM "02-hosts"
WHERE contains(file.tags, "host")
SORT role ASC
```

Also see [[01-overview/attack-surface]], [[01-overview/tls]], [[01-overview/smb]], [[01-overview/certs]].
